        "category": "offensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The pixie sprinkles pixie dust onto one of their arrows. If the pixie hits a creature with that arrow before the pixie's next turn, the arrow inflicts one of the following special effects of the pixie's choice instead of dealing damage. Each effect depends on the target's @Check[will|dc:24] save. On a critical hit, the target gets a result one degree worse than it rolled.</p><ul><li><strong>Sleepy</strong> (mental) The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for a round.</li><li><strong>Head Hurty</strong> (mental, nonlethal) The target takes @Damage[4d6[mental]] damage, depending on its basic Will save.</li></ul>"
        },
